infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two layers over one log: speed vs batch
  desc Lambda's split — the dashboard is fast, the money number is right
  compares
    - label Speed layer (streaming)
      children
        - label Seconds-fresh
          desc Flink windows feed the dashboard in near real time
        - label Approximate
          desc May drop a late click or double-count across a crash edge
        - label Self-healing
          desc Eventually-consistent — a small error corrects within minutes
        - label Watermark-pressured
          desc Closes a window once the lagged watermark passes its end
    - label Batch layer (reconciliation)
      children
        - label Hours-late
          desc Runs hourly/daily — billing tolerates latency to be right
        - label Authoritative
          desc Re-reads ALL raw events in cold storage, no watermark
        - label Source of truth
          desc Produces the daily total the billing system charges on
        - label No time pressure
          desc Every late straggler is present, so the count is exact
theme
  palette #0ea5e9 #10b981
